digivolved into Metal Greymon,

264
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:13,317
but we can't have him
turning into Skull Greymon,

265
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:16,753
so we helped start him off
from the beginning at Coromon.

266
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,310
What?

267
00:18:18,393 --> 00:18:19,520
Whatever works, I guess.

268
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:23,979
The location of the Star Plasma
Vessel has unfortunately been leaked.

269
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:25,150
Right now,

270
00:18:25,233 --> 00:18:28,657
there are two major groups who are
simultaneously after the young girl's life.

271
00:18:28,740 --> 00:18:30,960
One is the Curse User Group, Q.

272
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:34,980
They seek to upend Jujutsu
society with Tengen's rampage.

273
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:40,180
The other is the Star Religious Group,
also known as the Time Vessel Association,

274
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:42,240
who worships Tengen as a god.

275
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:47,700
But Tengen will assimilate the Star
Plasma Vessel in just two days' time.

276
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,037
You are to protect this
young girl till then,

277
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:53,017
and ensure that Tengen reaches
her before the others do.

278
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:56,857
If you fail, the effects will ripple
throughout even normal society.

279
00:18:56,940 --> 00:18:58,587
So put your heart into this!

280
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,510
You know,

281
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:03,620
I get why Curse User Group
Q would be after her,

282
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:07,597
but why would the Star Religious
Group want to kill some young kid?

283
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:10,720
Their object of worship is
the pure form of Tengen,

284
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:14,677
Allowing the Star Plasma Vessel,
an impurity in their minds,

285
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:16,760
to blend into him is unforgivable.

286
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:19,997
The Star Religious Group is
made up of non-sorcerers.

287
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:22,137
I don't think we need
to pay them any mind.

288
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:24,573
The ones to be wary of are definitely Q.

289
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,788
Oh, I'm sure it'll be fine.

290
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:28,902
We are the strongest, after all.

291
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:32,571
I mean, that's why Tengen asked
for us specifically, right?

292
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:34,880
Uh, huh? What is it?

293
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:40,220
You know, Satoru, I've been
meaning to say this for a while.

294
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:43,537
I think you should really stop
being so full of yourself.

295
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:44,450
Huh?

296
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:48,617
Especially when you're
addressing your superiors.

297
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:50,818
We might end up meeting Tengen soon.

298
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,597
You really should be
more polite and humble.

299
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:57,092
It would make you less threatening
to the juniors as well.

300
00:19:58,060 --> 00:19:59,460
Yeah, screw that.

301
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:01,080
Come on, Satoru.

302
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:02,590
Whatever.

303
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:04,308
We can talk about it later.

304
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:09,970
Coming!

305
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:11,550
Huh?

306
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:13,750
Huh?

307
00:20:18,220 --> 00:20:19,050
You alive?

308
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:20,740
I'm still breathing.

309
00:20:21,580 --> 00:20:24,639
You think we'll be blamed
if the kid died from that?

310
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,510
Uh-oh.

311
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:37,240
Don't blame me.

312
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:40,720
Hate Tengen if you must hate anyone

313
00:20:41,460 --> 00:20:42,290
What?

314
00:20:44,360 --> 00:20:46,937
Would you please stop
making us stand out so much?

315
00:20:47,020 --> 00:20:51,961
We just got called out for that this morning
So this girl is the Star Plasma Vessel?

316
00:20:52,080 --> 00:20:53,037
Those uniforms.

317
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:55,237
Your sorceress from Jujutsu High.

318
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:56,677
Hand over the kid.

319
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,077
Or I'll kill you!

320
00:20:58,160 --> 00:21:00,017
Can't quite hear you.

321
00:21:00,100 --> 00:21:02,060
Come closer so we can talk.

322
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:03,857
Nice catch.

323
00:21:03,940 --> 00:21:05,175
That was a close one.

324
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:10,390
Wonderful.

325
00:21:11,640 --> 00:21:13,940
You're Satoru Gojo, right?

326
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:15,400
You're famous.

327
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:18,260
I hear you're strong.

328
00:21:18,900 --> 00:21:21,194
Let me find out if the rumors are true.

329
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:23,120
Sure, I'm game.

330
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:25,000
But let's set some rules.

331
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:26,710
Rules?

332
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:29,937
You see, I don't want to get
yelled at for going overboard.

333
00:21:30,020 --> 00:21:33,180
So if you cry and apologize,
then I won't kill you.

334
00:21:33,740 --> 00:21:34,681
That's our rule.

335
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:36,340
You damn punk!

336
00:21:38,060 --> 00:21:39,320
It has started.

337
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:44,977
The Star Religious Group doesn't have the
power to fight against Jujutsu Sorcerers,

338
00:21:45,060 --> 00:21:46,820
but they can pay very well.

339
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:48,140
That I guarantee.

340
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,420
How about it, Zenin?

341
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:54,787
Want to get in on the assassination
of the Star Plasma Vessel?

342
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,940
I'm not a Zenin anymore.

343
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:58,880
I took my wife's name.

344
00:21:59,260 --> 00:22:00,900
It's Fushiguro now.

345
00:22:03,060 --> 00:22:05,600
But sure, count me in on all the fun.

346
00:22:52,460 --> 00:22:55,177
I don't want to hear anything

347
00:22:55,260 --> 00:22:59,677
What place I'm doing is there?

348
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:01,797
I'm sure I'm not here.

349
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:02,897
I'm not here.

350
00:23:02,980 --> 00:23:04,617
I'm not sure why I'm here.

351
00:23:04,700 --> 00:23:07,137
I'm not sure what I'm saying.

352
00:23:07,220 --> 00:23:09,297
I've seen a lot of things.

353
00:23:09,380 --> 00:23:10,210
I've seen a lot of things.

354
00:23:10,293 --> 00:23:11,897
I've seen a lot of things.

355
00:23:11,980 --> 00:23:14,517
You know, the sky is dark,
I'm afraid of the sky.

356
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:15,897
I'm afraid of the sky.

357
00:23:15,980 --> 00:23:16,937
I'm not looking at it.

358
00:23:17,020 --> 00:23:18,314
I'm not looking at it.

359
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:42,097
You know how some words
get stuck in your head,

360
00:23:42,180 --> 00:23:44,897
yeah, like homeowners
association requirements.

361
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:47,156
Uh-huh, or like universal healthcare.

362
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:49,837
Please watch the next
episode, Hidden Inventory 2.

363
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:50,997
What's yours, Shoko?

364
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:53,040
Fried chicken shop. Oh.
